From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:57:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] KitKat UI P33: keyboard launcher icon from the 4.4 donor
 (P33.1)

The authentic android-4.4.4_r1 LatinIME keyboard icon (latinime-4.4 donor mipmap set, vendored in the CandyOS repo at reference/donor-icons/latinime), byte-identical at the donor densities (mdpi..xxhdpi - the donor has no xxxhdpi). Replaces the adaptive mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml plus its background/foreground drawables with legacy full-bleed PNGs.

Change-Id: Id1e09d04a989841111726b04572e59754c315919
---
 java/res/drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml |  20 -----------
 java/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml |  34 -------------------
 java/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml   |   9 -----
 java/res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher.png         | Bin 0 -> 7646 bytes
 java/res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher.png         | Bin 0 -> 4349 bytes
 java/res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher.png        | Bin 0 -> 12231 bytes
 java/res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png       | Bin 0 -> 21221 bytes
